[en.IDEA_C12_HOLDERS_BOULDER]
Holder’s_Boulder

[en.IDEA_C12_HOLDERS_BOULDER_desc]
This colossal egg-shaped boulder is considered by experts in the archaeological community to be a fossilized ancient dragon egg. However, to the superstitious Pie familiy, the significance embodied by this massive stone surpasses anything else. It was the discovery of this boulder by an ancestor of the clan that led to the establishment of the stone farm nearby. As long as the Holder’s Boulder stands, the ponies of the  farm believe they will receive luck and protection in its shadow.

[zh.IDEA_C12_HOLDERS_BOULDER]
奠基顽石

[zh.IDEA_C12_HOLDERS_BOULDER_desc]
这座巨型的卵型巨石被考古界的专家认为是远古巨龙的蛋化石，但是在迷信岩石的派家族看来，这座巨石所象征的含义远远超过了其他任何事物，正是一位派家族的祖先发现了这块巨石，才有了后来在这块巨石边上所建立的石头农场。只要奠基顽石还屹立着，石头农场的小马们就会在它的阴影下获得好运和庇佑。
